  "display": {
    "case_id": "68065690",
    "target_stage": "Fresh Section 14(1)(b) findings by the Additional Rent Controller after the RCT permitted additional evidence and remanded for fresh findings.",
    "target_court": "Court of Sh. Ajay Nagar, Additional Rent Controller-02 (Central), Tis Hazari Courts, Delhi.",
    "records": [
      {
        "source_id": "IK-68065690:L76:span1",
        "aliases": {},
        "document_id": "68065690",
        "stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "text": "That the respondent has sub-let the Shop in question to one Shri Kapil Luthra S/o Shri Veer Bhan @ Rs.5500/- p.m. without the knowledge, consent or permission of the petitioner. Moreover, the sub letee namely Shri Kapil Luthra is using a shop in question as Godown and has taken exclusive possession of the shop in question."
      },
      {
        "source_id": "IK-68065690:L80:span2",
        "aliases": {},
        "document_id": "68065690",
        "stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "text": "shop is being used as a godown for storing spare parts, cycle etc. and the said fact is well within the knowledge of the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "source_id": "IK-68065690:L82:span3",
        "aliases": {},
        "document_id": "68065690",
        "stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "text": "It is denied by the respondent that the answering respondent has sublet the shop in question to Sh. Kapil Luthra, S/o Sh. Virbhan @ Rs.5500/- p.m. It is also denied that the alleged sub-lettee Sh. Kapil Luthra is using the shop in question as a godown and has taken exclusive possession of the same."
      },
      {
        "source_id": "IK-68065690:L83:span4",
        "aliases": {},
        "document_id": "68065690",
        "stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "text": "at no point of time, the shop in question was ever sublet or as- signed to Sh. Kapil Luthra. The answering respondent is running a cycle works shop from Shop No. 29/5, Shakti Nagar, Delhi-07 and the shop in dispute is being used by the Respondent as godown."
      },
      {
        "source_id": "IK-68065690:L84:span5",
        "aliases": {},
        "document_id": "68065690",
        "stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "text": "Kapil Luthra is only helping the answering respondent in his family business and no rent as alleged is being received by the answering respondent from Sh. Kapil Luthra."
      },
      {
        "source_id": "IK-68065690:L174:context-v4",
        "aliases": {
          "IK-68065690:L174:span6": [
            102,
            271
          ]
        },
        "document_id": "68065690",
        "stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "text": "35. Perusal of reply dt. 17.09.2009 to legal notice shows that respondent has inter alia claimed that \"Sh. Kapil Luthra is the nephew of my client and he is helping my client in the family business and my family is very much in possession of the shop as a lawful tenant.\""
      },
      {
        "source_id": "IK-68065690:L176:context-v4",
        "aliases": {
          "IK-68065690:L176:span7": [
            86,
            285
          ]
        },
        "document_id": "68065690",
        "stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "text": "37. But perusal of testimony of RW1 / respondent shows that he has inter alia deposed \"no partnership deed was executed with Veer Bhan Luthra and Sh. Kapil Luthra, it is all oral. I do not keep any account of the partnership. All in all is Sh. Veer Bhan. The partnership is since 1975."
      },
      {
        "source_id": "IK-68065690:L181:context-v4",
        "aliases": {
          "IK-68065690:L181:span8": [
            83,
            221
          ]
        },
        "document_id": "68065690",
        "stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
        "text": "40. Moreover, during the cross-examination, RW2, Sh. Kapil Luthra has deposed that \"I conduct the business in the name of Luthra Cycle Stores from the disputed premises. I do not have any other shop or any other business."
      }
    ]
  },
